## Data Structures
### map_t Structure:
```c
typedef struct map_s {
    char **grid;    // 2D character array for the map
    int rows;       // Number of rows
    int cols;       // Number of columns  
    int **dp;       // Dynamic programming table
} map_t;
```

### square_t Structure:
```c
typedef struct square_s {
    int row;        // Top-left row of the square
    int col;        // Top-left column of the square
    int size;       // Size of the square
} square_t;
```

